{
  "body": "Revise-primary-plan for Delivery finding dist-delivery-retirement-allocation. TG-08/E1–E3 allocate scoped R14 admission, R19 old/replacement execution before deletion and R22 actual measurements. No upstream behavior changes. Four implementation milestones: prove actual two-parent anchored relocation and rejection/retention outside discovery; integrate force and two-target producer/installer/Release consumers; transfer mirror protection before script/selector retirement; remove exact old sources and reconcile readers. Fresh whole-change Code Review then distinct Verify remain mandatory. No work entries are initialized before Delivery Review. The exact plan and navigation are authored; future tests, runtime functionality, deletion, final adoption and publication are not claimed. Prior design choices/checks remain scoped to their original identities, while current plan relies on Proposal Review r3 and Design Review r5 and their resolved findings.",
  "change_id": "2026-09-10-distribution-model-and-opencode-retirement",
